  m_Name: Engineer Cromwell
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Engineer Cromwell
  offerText: Purchase my automated thermal generator. It takes practically no space
    and a tiny fee, but it will instantly flood your quarters with relaxing, warm
    air.
  acceptResultText: The machine is gigantic! It is deafeningly loud and only blows
    freezing cold air. You have been completely lied to.
  rejectResultText: You decline the shady technology. You wrap yourself in a blanket
    instead, enjoying the quiet.
  acceptedDelayedText: The machine was illegally siphoning power from the city grid!
    The authorities fine you massively, and you get a severe electrical shock trying
    to unplug it.
  rejectedDelayedText: Without a proper heater, the harsh night chill sets deep into
    your bones, leaving you stiff and aching.
